    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE GAME:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout history, we have always been astounded and amazed by the wonders of the natural world. In Wild Realms, you can play as one of many species of animal across two distinct Realms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CURRENT GAMEPLAY FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly 40 different species to play as across all maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct and vibrant Realms, each with a selection of maps to play on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Mechanics such as Hunger, Thirst, Health, Stamina, and Oxygen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status Effects to aid in hunting such as Venom and Blood-loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple combat mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;game master&quot; mode where the server's host can give players waypoints, spawn NPC animals, and observe the world freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic ecosystems with NPC animals and logic to help prevent upsets in the food-chain (NPC animals can be disabled by the host).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer maps with simplified gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer PvP and Co-op via Steam's invitation system for up to 10 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game score system used for respawning (can be toggled on and off by the host).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized graphics (with minimal blood).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of species use special movement mechanics such as flying, swimming, and diving underwater. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game tips to offer new players hints on how to play the game (press &quot;ESC&quot; while using an animal to access). <br><br><br>NOTICE:<br>Wild Realms will no longer be getting updates as I am working on making better refined projects. Please consider this before buying the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE GAME:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout history, we have always been astounded and amazed by the wonders of the natural world. In Wild Realms, you can play as one of many species of animal across two distinct Realms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CURRENT GAMEPLAY FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly 40 different species to play as across all maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct and vibrant Realms, each with a selection of maps to play on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Mechanics such as Hunger, Thirst, Health, Stamina, and Oxygen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status Effects to aid in hunting such as Venom and Blood-loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple combat mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;game master&quot; mode where the server's host can give players waypoints, spawn NPC animals, and observe the world freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic ecosystems with NPC animals and logic to help prevent upsets in the food-chain (NPC animals can be disabled by the host).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer maps with simplified gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer PvP and Co-op via Steam's invitation system for up to 10 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game score system used for respawning (can be toggled on and off by the host).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized graphics (with minimal blood).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of species use special movement mechanics such as flying, swimming, and diving underwater. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game tips to offer new players hints on how to play the game (press &quot;ESC&quot; while using an animal to access). <br><br><br>NOTICE:<br>Wild Realms will no longer be getting updates as I am working on making better refined projects. Please consider this before buying the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
